{"id":"85bd7d1b8a5de2a93f7946fd42048406f659f35c","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251149","title":"claude 的重置是真的狗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"wyfig","excerpt":"程序员 - @wyfig - 讲个笑话，昨天为了有效利用 10 月 23 日到期的 Claude 的一次重置机会，晚上加班狂蹬做自己的额度，终于用到将近 80%的周限额，说明天 10 月 23 号，等早上起来就重置。 结","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>讲个笑话，昨天为了有效利用 10 月 23 日到期的 Claude 的一次重置机会，晚上加班狂蹬做自己的额度，终于用到将近 80%的周限额，说明天 10 月 23 号，等早上起来就重置。  </p>\n<p>结果一觉醒来，发现唯一的重置已经没有了。。。。</p>\n<p>令人安慰的是，codex 可能知道我比较失落，一大早给我重置到 100%了。</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-10-23 10:53:26 +08:00\">16h 30m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>其实应该能早点想到这个问题。Claude 上面显示的周重置时间，我这边对应的就是北京时间，比如晚上 9 点，那刚好晚上 9 点重置。 显示 10 月 23 日到期，那就对应的是 10 月 22 号晚上 12 点整。23 号开始就直接是过期的。 之前没反应过来还想着是不是按照美国时间，其实不是的，是按照自己使用的时区显示的。</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212683\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8af2/32d4/123350_normal.png?m=1669598194\" alt=\"gap\" data-uid=\"123350\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gap\">gap</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:05:31 +08:00\">17h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>幸亏昨天晚上用掉了，本来也准备今天再来用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212691\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f7b4/469d/469348_normal.png?m=1581758320\" alt=\"gibber\" data-uid=\"469348\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gibber\">gibber</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:06:34 +08:00\">17h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 不是也有一张 23 号到期的重置卡吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212701\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1ae4a1ed839e04640e036b215ef9ca61?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vk42\" data-uid=\"457897\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vk42\">vk42</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:07:24 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还好我提前查了确认了下过期时间，昨天晚上就用了，但它家重置卡不重置周重置的时间，这点还是挺爽</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212704\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7f8/f150/555057_normal.png?m=1666850391\" alt=\"f5a599\" data-uid=\"555057\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/f5a599\">f5a599</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:07:32 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为啥不早点用呢，就算踩点重置成功 3 天时间你能蹬完 100%吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212717\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a6401415a1e1659b63b3a0469039b30b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Greenm\" data-uid=\"282972\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Greenm\">Greenm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:08:31 +08:00\">17h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>是你自己卡得太死了吧，claude 的重置是最良心的，不中断你本来重置的时间，不干扰你的计划，完完全全的白送。</p><p>唯一缺点就是重置次数太少了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212921\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/95d5e1a7b136cd566c2495f0982d6fb3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wyfig\" data-uid=\"686987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wyfig\">wyfig</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:30:23 +08:00\">16h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/vk42\">vk42</a> #1 应该昨天晚上睡觉前就直接重置了，后悔也来不及了。  </p><p>@<a href=\"/member/vk42\">vk42</a> #3 昨天还看到 V2EX 上面有人说这个问题来着，还是没注意。 </p><p>@<a href=\"/member/f5a599\">f5a599</a> #4 就是想踩点哈 </p><p>@<a href=\"/member/Greenm\">Greenm</a> #5 这点确实是挺好的。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18212962\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c8d26ce0f7383023eb589e5f346e0a95?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"huangya\" data-uid=\"122114\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/huangya\">huangya</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:34:47 +08:00\">16h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>楼主这个重置卡是什么时候送的，我都不知道。claude code cli 不能查找自己是否有卡吗？好像没有看到命令（/usage 命令没看到）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18213002\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/95d5e1a7b136cd566c2495f0982d6fb3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wyfig\" data-uid=\"686987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wyfig\">wyfig</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:40:14 +08:00\">16h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/huangya\">huangya</a> 有一阵子了， 应该每个人都有，在客户端上面的用量里就能看到。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18213017\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/627e/eea7/215669_normal.png?m=1774227938\" alt=\"dcatfly\" data-uid=\"215669\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dcatfly\">dcatfly</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-23 10:41:47 +08:00\">16h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在浏览器的请求中可以看到准确的重置时间，直接问 Claude 也能说出准确的重置时间</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18213252\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/230e/a94a/352078_normal.png?m=1791764604\" alt=\"tab16360\" data-uid=\"352078\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\